          %p There is a rich and fascinating literature on these structures; we confine ourselves only to a very succinct (and cryptic) description.
          %p
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi E
                    %mn 8
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_8
            is the group of linear isometries of a root system consisting of vectors
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi x
